('seo-1786717957262-p00a3', 'https://www.finalattemptias.com/article-3-constitution-state-name-area-boundaries', 'Article 3 of Constitution: State Name, Area & Boundary Changes', 'Learn about Article 3 of the Indian Constitution, its procedure for changing state names, areas and boundaries, and the Kerala to Keralam name change proposal.', 'Article 3 of Constitution, Article 3 Indian Constitution, Kerala to Keralam, Kerala Name Change Bill 2026, State Reorganisation in India, formation of new states, alteration of state boundaries, BPSC Polity, UPSC Polity '),
