('seo-1786762995853-5v5co', 'https://finalattemptias.com/bhagalpur-madhepura-mega-bridge-bihar', 'Bhagalpur–Madhepura Mega Bridge: Bihar Regional Connectivity Boost', 'The Bhagalpur–Madhepura Mega Bridge is 98.7% complete and set to open by February 2027. Connecting NH-31 and NH-106, it boosts travel and trade across Bihar.', 'Bhagalpur Madhepura Mega Bridge, Bihpur Phulaut Bridge, Bihar Infrastructure News, NH 31 to NH 106 Connectivity, Saharsa Regional Connectivity, Mega Bridge Project Bihar'),
('seo-1786762998993-4xy3l', 'https://finalattemptias.com/bihar-mandatory-registration-apartment-societies-urban-areas', 'Bihar Mandatory Registration for Urban Apartment Societies | Final Attempt IAS', 'Bihar Government makes registration mandatory for urban apartment societies to improve accountability, facility management, and urban governance across state cities.', 'Bihar mandatory apartment registration, Bihar urban governance, Cooperative Department Bihar, Urban Development and Housing Department Bihar, BPSC current affairs, Bihar housing rules'),
('seo-1786771639186-magan', 'https://finalattemptias.com/arunachal-govt-jobs-prc-st-language-mandatory', 'Arunachal Govt Jobs: PRC, APST & Tribal Language Now Mandatory', 'Arunachal Pradesh Cabinet mandates PRC, APST status, and local tribal language proficiency for state government jobs, replacing the 80:20 recruitment ratio. Read key highlights on Final Attempt.', 'Arunachal Pradesh govt jobs eligibility, PRC mandatory Arunachal, APST certificate requirement, tribal language test APPSC APSSB, Arunachal 80 20 recruitment ratio, Pema Khandu cabinet decision 2026, Final Attempt IAS current affairs'),
('seo-1786771662805-binl3', 'https://finalattemptias.com/arunachal-govt-jobs-prc-st-language-mandatory', 'Arunachal Govt Jobs: PRC, APST & Tribal Language Now Mandatory', 'Arunachal Pradesh Cabinet mandates PRC, APST status, and local tribal language proficiency for state government jobs, replacing the 80:20 recruitment ratio. Read key highlights on Final Attempt.', 'Arunachal Pradesh govt jobs eligibility, PRC mandatory Arunachal, APST certificate requirement, tribal language test APPSC APSSB, Arunachal 80 20 recruitment ratio, Pema Khandu cabinet decision 2026, Final Attempt IAS current affairs'),
('seo-1787142324766-xv2l7', 'https://www.finalattemptias.com/blog/surrogate-advertising-consumer-protection-maharashtra-fda', 'Surrogate Advertising in India: Laws, Consumer Protection & Maharashtra FDA Action', 'Learn what surrogate advertising means, why it concerns consumer protection and public health, and how Indian laws regulate indirect advertising through the Maharashtra FDA\'s Vimal Elaichi case.', 'surrogate advertising in India, surrogate advertising meaning, surrogate advertising laws in India, Maharashtra FDA Vimal Elaichi, Vimal Elaichi surrogate advertising, celebrity endorsement and surrogate advertising, Consumer Protection Act 2019 misleading advertisements, COTPA Section 5, Food Safety and Standards Act Section 24, misleading food advertisements, tobacco advertising ban India, consumer protection India'),
('seo-1787142335908-aw78c', '/indonesia-earthquake-flores-region-ring-of-fire', 'Indonesia Earthquake in Flores Region: Geography & Ring of Fire', 'A 5.9-magnitude earthquake struck Indonesia’s Flores region. Learn about Indonesia’s geography, Ring of Fire location, major islands, borders and volcanic activity.', 'Indonesia earthquake, Flores earthquake, Indonesia geography, Ring of Fire, Indonesia volcanoes, active volcanoes in Indonesia, Indonesia tectonic plates, Southeast Asia geography'),
('seo-1787142339290-t136r', 'https://www.finalattemptias.com/blog/surrogate-advertising-consumer-protection-maharashtra-fda', 'Surrogate Advertising in India: Laws, Consumer Protection & Maharashtra FDA Action', 'Learn what surrogate advertising means, why it concerns consumer protection and public health, and how Indian laws regulate indirect advertising through the Maharashtra FDA\'s Vimal Elaichi case.', 'surrogate advertising in India, surrogate advertising meaning, surrogate advertising laws in India, Maharashtra FDA Vimal Elaichi, Vimal Elaichi surrogate advertising, celebrity endorsement and surrogate advertising, Consumer Protection Act 2019 misleading advertisements, COTPA Section 5, Food Safety and Standards Act Section 24, misleading food advertisements, tobacco advertising ban India, consumer protection India'),
('seo-1787142350432-kyxax', '/indonesia-earthquake-flores-region-ring-of-fire', 'Indonesia Earthquake in Flores Region: Geography & Ring of Fire', 'A 5.9-magnitude earthquake struck Indonesia’s Flores region. Learn about Indonesia’s geography, Ring of Fire location, major islands, borders and volcanic activity.', 'Indonesia earthquake, Flores earthquake, Indonesia geography, Ring of Fire, Indonesia volcanoes, active volcanoes in Indonesia, Indonesia tectonic plates, Southeast Asia geography'),
('seo-1787144522389-xngib', '/draft-shanti-rules-2026-nuclear-energy-framework', 'Draft SHANTI Rules 2026: Key Provisions & Nuclear Energy Framework', 'Explore the Draft SHANTI Rules, 2026 covering nuclear licensing, liability, decommissioning, radiation safety and the implementation of the SHANTI Act, 2025.', 'Draft SHANTI Rules 2026, SHANTI Rules 2026, SHANTI Act 2025, nuclear energy India, nuclear liability, nuclear energy regulations, AERB, nuclear power India, SMR India'),
