('seo-1789412608373-bmk21', 'https://finalattemptias.com/current-affairs/daily/2026-09-11/bihar/2026-09-11-bihar-bihar-to-get-high-tech-indoor-stadium-at-patliputra-sports-complex-by-march-2027', 'Bihar to Get High-Tech Indoor Stadium at Patliputra Sports Complex by March 2027 | Final Attempt', 'The High-Tech Indoor Stadium-II is being constructed at a cost of ₹21.20 crore. The facility is expected to be completed by March 2027 and will strengthen ', 'Bihar to Get High-Tech Indoor Stadium at Patliputra Sports Complex by March 2027, BIHAR, Bihar State Current Affairs, Bihar Economy & Governance, BPSC General Studies, BPSC, UPSC CSE, State PCS, bihar, current-affairs, bpsc-prelims, mains-notes, hightech, indoor, stadium'),
('seo-1789413213119-yewbb', 'https://finalattemptias.com/current-affairs/daily/2026-09-11/national/2026-09-11-national-registered-unrecognised-political-parties-latest-news-and-political-funding-concerns', 'Registered Unrecognised Political Parties: Latest News and Political Funding Concerns | Final Attempt', 'A recent media investigation has revealed that six Registered Unrecognised Political Parties (RUPPs), all based in Gujarat, received donations of around ₹1', 'Registered Unrecognised Political Parties: Latest News and Political Funding Concerns, NATIONAL, National Polity & Governance, Economy & Development, General Studies, BPSC, UPSC CSE, State PCS, national, current-affairs, bpsc-prelims, mains-notes, registered, unrecognised, political, parties');
